  {
    "ref": "U00189",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e171]: Door covers for themed parties and festivals.Essentials for Halloween party decoration.Essentials for large holiday parties.Provide door covers of various sizes and themes. Porch decorative door covers, very suitable for outdoor large-scale holiday gatherings!.These elements create a better atmosphere for holding festive party decorations. Hang on the front door decoration and spend a good time on happy festivals and large parties."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00190",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e172]: \"◆Three Sizes to Choose: Small: 82cm x 200cm / 32 x 79 inches, Medium: 90cm x 200cm / 36 x 79 inches, Large: 91cm x 248cm / 36 x 97 inches. Please measure the size of the door before ordering, and then select the appropriate size.\""
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00191",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e173]: \"◆High-Quality Door Cover: The decorations door cover is made of lightweight fabric, it is weather-resistant and highly durable. It uses premium colorfast permanent dye to create colorful, vibrant designs artwork.\""
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00192",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e174]: \"◆Multi Functions: No tools required for installation and removal in just a few minutes, the front is flat and wrinkle free.Easy to find the door handle position.Most people use it for kitchen,living room, utility room, garage,stairwell.\""
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00193",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e175]: \"◆Easy to Clean: Hand wash or machine wash, dry in a cool place. Please use mild neutral detergent as detergent.Can be folded for multiple use. Don't iron. Keep away from flames.\""
  },
  {
